research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-refuter-refute-f1-cardinal-core.log:7097:items/thm-konig.md:99:**What it is used for on this page.** With $\lambda_i$ constant the product becomes an exponential, and the resulting inequality bounds the cofinality of a power from below; that consequence is [[cor-cofinality-of-a-cardinal-power]], and it is the only ZFC constraint on $2^{\aleph_0}$ established here.
